  "songHowFindTitle": "Kutafuta wimbo",
  "@songHowFindTitle": {
    "description": "SongLib guide section title"
  },
  "songHowFindBody": "Andika kwenye kisanduku cha utafutaji kilicho juu ili kupata wimbo kwa nambari, jina au maneno yake. Bonyeza S popote ili kwenda kwenye kisanduku. Vichujio vilivyo juu ya orodha hupunguza nyimbo hadi kitabu kimoja cha nyimbo.",
  "@songHowFindBody": {
    "description": "SongLib guide for finding songs"
  },
  "songHowReadTitle": "Kusoma wimbo",
  "@songHowReadTitle": {
    "description": "SongLib guide section title"
  },
  "songHowReadBody": "Chagua wimbo kwenye orodha ili mistari yake ionekane upande wa kulia. Jina la wimbo na kitabu chake vitaonekana juu ya dirisha.",
  "@songHowReadBody": {
    "description": "SongLib guide for reading songs"
  },
  "songHowPresentTitle": "Kuwasilisha",
  "@songHowPresentTitle": {
    "description": "SongLib guide section title"
  },
  "songHowPresentBody": "Bofya wimbo mara mbili, bonyeza Enter au uchague Wasilisha wimbo kwenye Chaguo za haraka ili kuufungua kwenye kioneshi. Pitia mistari slaidi moja baada ya nyingine; badilisha mwelekeo wa slaidi kwenye Mipangilio. Maneno hupangwa yatoshe skrini. Kitufe cha orodha kwenye kichwa cha kioneshi huonyesha mistari yote kwenye paneli ya pembeni na kuangazia mstari wa sasa. Paneli huanza ikiwa wazi; bonyeza kitufe tena kuificha.",
  "@songHowPresentBody": {
    "description": "SongLib guide for presenting songs"
  },
  "songHowKeysTitle": "Vifunguo vya kioneshi",
  "@songHowKeysTitle": {
    "description": "SongLib guide section title"
  },
  "songHowKeysBody": "Mshale wa kulia au chini: slaidi inayofuata.\nMshale wa kushoto au juu: slaidi iliyotangulia.\n1 hadi 7: nenda kwenye mstari huo.\nC: nenda kwenye kiitikio.\nL: nenda kwenye slaidi ya mwisho.\n- : punguza maandishi.\n= : ongeza maandishi kadiri mstari mrefu zaidi unavyotoshea.\nEsc: funga kioneshi.",
  "@songHowKeysBody": {
    "description": "SongLib presenter keyboard shortcuts"
  },
  "songHowQuickTitle": "Chaguo za haraka",
  "@songHowQuickTitle": {
    "description": "SongLib guide section title"
  },
  "songHowQuickBody": "Kitufe cha Chaguo za haraka kilicho chini kulia huonyesha unachoweza kufanya na wimbo uliochaguliwa: kunakili maneno yake, kuupenda au kuuwasilisha.",
  "@songHowQuickBody": {
    "description": "SongLib guide for quick actions"
  },
  "songHowLikesTitle": "Vinavyopendwa",
  "@songHowLikesTitle": {
    "description": "SongLib guide section title"
  },
  "songHowLikesBody": "Nyimbo unazopenda hukusanywa kwenye Vinavyopendwa kwenye paneli ya pembeni ili uweze kuzifungua haraka.",
  "@songHowLikesBody": {
    "description": "SongLib guide for liked songs"
  },
  "songHowBooksTitle": "Vitabu vya nyimbo na masasisho",
  "@songHowBooksTitle": {
    "description": "SongLib guide section title"
  },
  "songHowBooksBody": "Vitabu vyako vya nyimbo huhifadhiwa kwenye kifaa hiki na kusasishwa chinichini ukiwa mtandaoni. Ili kuchagua vitabu tofauti, fungua Mipangilio kisha uchague Vitabu vya nyimbo.",
  "@songHowBooksBody": {
    "description": "SongLib guide for songbook storage and updates"
  },
  "bibleHowReadingTitle": "Kusoma",
  "@bibleHowReadingTitle": {
    "description": "BibleLib guide section title"
  },
  "bibleHowReadingBody": "Tumia kitufe cha Biblia kilicho juu kubadilisha tafsiri na kitufe cha sura kwenda sura nyingine. Vilivyo chini vya Iliyotangulia na Inayofuata husogeza sura moja moja, au bonyeza Alt pamoja na mshale wa kushoto au kulia. Mishale ya juu na chini husogeza sura. Vifunguo hivi hufanya kazi tu BibleLib ikiwa wazi.",
  "@bibleHowReadingBody": {
    "description": "BibleLib guide for reading"
  },
  "bibleHowTextTitle": "Ukubwa wa maandishi na kusogeza kiotomatiki",
  "@bibleHowTextTitle": {
    "description": "BibleLib guide section title"
  },
  "bibleHowTextBody": "Aa- na Aa+ kwenye kichwa hubadilisha ukubwa wa maandishi. Unaweza pia kubonyeza - kwenye kibodi kuyapunguza na = kuyaongeza. Kusogeza kiotomatiki chini kushoto husogeza sura; tumia alama za kuongeza na kupunguza kuweka kasi, na gusa maandishi kusimamisha.",
  "@bibleHowTextBody": {
    "description": "BibleLib guide for text size and auto scroll"
  },
  "bibleHowParallelTitle": "Biblia sambamba",
  "@bibleHowParallelTitle": {
    "description": "BibleLib guide section title"
  },
  "bibleHowParallelBody": "Pakua Biblia zaidi ya moja na uwashe Kisomaji cha Biblia nyingi kwenye Chaguo za haraka ili kuonyesha tafsiri nyingine chini ya kila mstari.",
  "@bibleHowParallelBody": {
    "description": "BibleLib guide for parallel translations"
  },
  "bibleHowSelectTitle": "Kuchagua mistari",
  "@bibleHowSelectTitle": {
    "description": "BibleLib guide section title"
  },
  "bibleHowSelectBody": "Bofya mistari ili kuichagua. Kisha upau wa juu hukuwezesha kuiwekea alamisho au kuiangazia, kuongeza dokezo kwenye mstari mmoja au kuinakili. Bonyeza Esc kughairi uteuzi.",
  "@bibleHowSelectBody": {
    "description": "BibleLib guide for selecting verses"
  },
  "bibleHowSearchTitle": "Utafutaji",
  "@bibleHowSearchTitle": {
    "description": "BibleLib guide section title"
  },
  "bibleHowSearchBody": "Utafutaji hupitia kila mstari wa Biblia unayochagua na kukupeleka moja kwa moja kwenye matokeo. Utafutaji uliopita huhifadhiwa kwa matumizi yajayo.",
  "@bibleHowSearchBody": {
    "description": "BibleLib guide for Bible search"
  },
  "bibleHowHistoryTitle": "Historia",
  "@bibleHowHistoryTitle": {
    "description": "BibleLib guide section title"
  },
  "bibleHowHistoryBody": "Historia huorodhesha sura ulizosoma na utafutaji uliofanya ili uendelee ulipoishia.",
  "@bibleHowHistoryBody": {
    "description": "BibleLib guide for history"
  },
  "bibleHowBookmarksTitle": "Alamisho na madokezo",
  "@bibleHowBookmarksTitle": {
    "description": "BibleLib guide section title"
  },
  "bibleHowBookmarksBody": "Kila kitu unachowekea alamisho au kuandikia dokezo hukusanywa kwenye Alamisho na madokezo katika paneli ya pembeni, kwenye Biblia zako zote.",
  "@bibleHowBookmarksBody": {
    "description": "BibleLib guide for bookmarks and notes"
  },
  "bibleHowOpenerTitle": "Kifungua maandiko",
  "@bibleHowOpenerTitle": {
    "description": "BibleLib guide section title"
  },
  "bibleHowOpenerBody": "Kifungua maandiko kwenye kichwa hufungua kifungu kwa kuandika kitabu, sura na mstari wake. Ongeza vifungu kadhaa kwenye foleni ili kuvifungua kimoja baada ya kingine.",
  "@bibleHowOpenerBody": {
    "description": "BibleLib guide for Scripture Opener"
  },
  "bibleHowListsTitle": "Orodha za maandiko",
  "@bibleHowListsTitle": {
    "description": "BibleLib guide section title"
  },
  "bibleHowListsBody": "Maandiko kwenye paneli ya pembeni huhifadhi orodha za vifungu unavyotumia tena, kama muhtasari wa mahubiri. Bonyeza Cheza kwenye orodha kupitia mistari yake kwa kutumia upau wa foleni ulio chini.",
  "@bibleHowListsBody": {
    "description": "BibleLib guide for saved scripture lists"
  },
  "bibleHowManageTitle": "Kusimamia Biblia",
  "@bibleHowManageTitle": {
    "description": "BibleLib guide section title"
  },
  "bibleHowManageBody": "Ongeza, ondoa au chagua tafsiri yako kuu kwenye Mipangilio na Biblia, au kupitia Chagua Biblia kwenye kichwa.",
  "@bibleHowManageBody": {
    "description": "BibleLib guide for Bible management"
  },
